## 3. Key Conversations – Hội thoại giao tiếp

![Quán cà phê — nơi thực hành giao tiếp tiếng Anh lý tưởng](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085?w=700&q=80)

### Conversation A: Gọi món tại nhà hàng

> **Waiter:** Good evening! Are you ready to order?
> **Customer:** Yes, I'd like the grilled chicken, please.
> **Waiter:** Of course. Would you like some soup with that?
> **Customer:** Yes, please. And can I have a glass of orange juice?
> **Waiter:** Certainly. Anything else?
> **Customer:** No, that's all. Thank you!

---

### Conversation B: Mời bạn bè ăn uống

> **A:** Hey, are you hungry?
> **B:** Yes, a little. What do you have?
> **A:** I have some bread and eggs. Would you like an omelette?
> **B:** That sounds great! Do you have any cheese?
> **A:** Sorry, I don't have any. But I have some vegetables.
> **B:** Perfect. I love vegetable omelettes!

---

### Conversation C: Ở quán cà phê

> **Barista:** Hi! What can I get for you?
> **A:** I'd like a medium latte, please.
> **Barista:** Hot or iced?
> **A:** Iced, please. Oh, and how much is a croissant?
> **Barista:** It's two dollars fifty.
> **A:** Great, I'll have one of those too.
> **Barista:** So that's one iced latte and one croissant. Is that for here or to go?
> **A:** To go, please.

